Round 7 Brain build of dc-r7-script-walk-v4 (main's director6 judgement), in script mode:
- the reply is assembled last, from parts no guard can cut: verdict → park/return → give-up → worked answer → missed-card close → authored text → card;
- the point is never doubled;
- then-cards are whole and show their own board;
- the worked example is one step per turn;
- wrongIfMis is matched before by-value;
- a missed card is closed after its follow-up;
- a left card always says its key;
- every scripted skill is walked in order before any ladder;
- asides are parked and returned;
- the H1.2 counters are added.
